  "details": "Request for a haptic notifier for chatboxes similar to how a cell phone on silent could vibrate for notifications. On the android build it's difficult to catch chatboxes in portrait mode visually and it's rather to hear hard due to tinny speakers. I also play android build with speakers muted most times and it's rather hard to catch chats at all, especially when trying to type replies and entire view is obscured by on screen keyboard. This would also be beneficial for VR, especially if implimented in a way that controlled haptic intensity and handedness based on proximity and direction to help those playing with low or no audio.",
